      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 5 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>LRU / LFU Cache with Pluggable Eviction</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build the cache that Amazon, Microsoft, Walmart, Salesforce and Sprinklr ask as \"implement LRU\", and that Groww and PhonePe stretch into a full machine-coding round: O(1) get and put with a hand-written hash map plus doubly linked list, an eviction policy you can swap (LRU, LFU, FIFO), TTL, read-through loading, write-through versus write-back, two cache levels and thread safety. Running Java, Python and C++14 code included.</p>\n"
  },
